    "body": "fix on issue/3035-adaptive-fallback-warning · PR #3108 · pinned by strategy_fallback::an_adaptive_fallback_to_offset_rings_is_a_warning, machining3d::hsm::fallback_tests::a_refused_level_counts_as_one_rings_fallback · merges when reviewed\n\nThe PR is partial work (Refs #3035). It does the warning part only: an Adaptive fallback to Offset rings is now an advisory warning with the number of areas. Two parts stay open on this issue:\n- the run time of Rough12, Rest6 and Waterline6 on the mould core;\n- a long generate that blocks every other MCP call, with no cancel tool.\n\nThe PR is stacked on #3062. Merge #3062 first.\n",
