    "body": "Claim released. STOPPED because the remaining fix overlaps a held pull request.\n\nRest generation simulates previous operations in collect_job in crates/app/src/operation/job.rs. This work runs before the generation worker starts. It can still block read and save calls. The runtime budget must include this work.\n\nPR #2999 changes collect_job and has the needs-maintainer label. That PR is also stacked. The worker instructions prohibit stacking on this PR. PRs #3283, #3251, #3115, #3059, #3058 and #2993 also change collect_job.\n\nTwo tests failed at runtime on unchanged upstream/main 62353ac75:\n- a_queued_cancellation_refuses_generation_without_a_cached_path\n- a_queued_read_answers_before_generation_completes\n\nThe original QA project directory is absent on this machine. The tests use a small stock and Face operation.\n\nThe incomplete patch remains local at .claude/worktrees/issue-3035 on issue/3035-generation-budget. It is not committed or pushed. No PR is open. The patch still needs deferred rest simulation, stream lifetime corrections, mutation checks and the full gate. It is not ready to use.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
